    61	class Connections:
    62	    """The databases one request reads: opened on entry, closed on exit, never shared between threads. The ledger's committed state
    63	    is pinned by BEGIN and a first read, so every read of the request sees one state while a writer commits (live-service/
    64	    OPERATING-CONTRACT.md, row 2); a failure while opening closes what was already opened."""
